{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号浅灰标题最先吸引视线，字号、亮度和位置都明显占优；下方音符动画面积大但对比度较低，右上角目录文字较小。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"可能已经找不回曾经的亲近，正在尝试先把眼前的生活过稳。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"失落、克制、略带无奈，同时有接受现实、继续往前走的意味。\",\n  \"missed\": \"害怕其实仍然存在，但脚步已经开始向前；音乐从试探到逐渐聚拢、前进感越来越强的具体变化。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"标题能直接传达处境和应对态度，但具体的核心情绪需要借助下方较小的说明文字进一步确认。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "747a8cfc-5afc-4e6a-84ee-299e4ff26883", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023510352355Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:35:32.235944+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0b06aee9d427bf7f4c1e87ae77b95fd93e42b5fcea8d2265e594a8232a2d76ab", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be